graph TD
    A[Authentication Request] --> B{Rate Limited?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Block Request]
    B -->|No| D{Device Known?}

    D -->|No| E[Enhanced Validation]
    D -->|Yes| F{Behavioral Normal?}

    E --> G{Liveness Detected?}
    G -->|No| H[Reject - Spoofing]
    G -->|Yes| I{Attestation Valid?}

    I -->|No| J[Reject - Invalid Device]
    I -->|Yes| K[Allow with Monitoring]

    F -->|No| L{Suspicious Level?}
    F -->|Yes| M[Standard Flow]

    L -->|High| N[Block + Alert]
    L -->|Medium| O[Additional Verification]
    L -->|Low| P[Allow with Logging]

    O --> Q{Challenge Passed?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Allow Access]
    Q -->|No| S[Block Access]

    style C fill:#ffcdd2
    style H fill:#ffcdd2
    style J fill:#ffcdd2
    style N fill:#ffcdd2
    style S fill:#ffcdd2
    style R fill:#c8e6c9
    style M fill:#c8e6c9
    style K fill:#fff9c4
    style P fill:#fff9c4
